<div class="home-container">
    <form action="/reset-database" method="POST">
    <button type="submit">Reset Database</button>
    </form>

    <h1>🌿 GreenLeaf Plant Care</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
        A database-driven application for managing plant collections and tracking plant care.
    </p>

    <section class="card">
        <h2>About the Project</h2>

        <p>
            Developed by <strong>Cameron Kuykendall</strong> and
            <strong>James Cecconi</strong>, GreenLeaf Plant Care helps users organize
            and monitor their indoor and outdoor plant collections.
        </p>

        <p>
            The application allows users to manage plants, plant species,
            growing locations, inventory items, and plant care logs from a
            centralized database.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="stats-grid">

        <div class="stat-card">
            <h3>👤 Users</h3>
            <p>1,000–2,000 registered users</p>
        </div>

        <div class="stat-card">
            <h3>🪴 Plants</h3>
            <p>10,000–20,000 plants</p>
        </div>

        <div class="stat-card">
            <h3>🌱 Species</h3>
            <p>150–250 plant species</p>
        </div>

        <div class="stat-card">
            <h3>📝 Care Logs</h3>
            <p>100,000+ care logs annually</p>
        </div>

    </section>

    <section class="card">
        <h2>Features</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Manage users and plant collections</li>
            <li>Browse and maintain plant species</li>
            <li>Track plant locations</li>
            <li>Manage fertilizers, pesticides, and supplies</li>
            <li>Record watering, fertilizing, pruning, repotting, and pest treatments</li>
            <li>View and update complete plant care histories</li>
        </ul>
    </section>


</div>
